window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Johanna Palmer is very much over relationships.</b></p> <p>After a scarring experience her freshman year of college, she’s decided she’d much rather have something fun than something serious.</p> <p>Her best friend Miller has seen it all - the tears, the parties, the drunken phone calls at four in the morning when she needed a ride. In fact, there might be several things Miller saw that Jo herself can’t remember.</p> <p>Things Miller can’t forget.</p> <p>With the whirlwind of senior year underway, Jo just wants to move on, get her degree, and land her dream job. But her past might not be as easy to outrun as she’d hoped.</p> <p><b><i>The Anti-Relationship Year</i></b><b> is a friends-to-lovers college romance that acts as a companion to </b><b><i>The Anti-Virginity Pact</i></b><b>. Both books can be listened to as stand-alones.</b></p>"; 
